WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.310
Seat's all mine!

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:04.650
You jerk!

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.060
There's room next to me.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:08.980
Wanna sit?

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.000
Actually, I'll stand.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.080
Yeah? Okay.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.090
<i>He seriously doesn't have a clue!</i>

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:34.880
<i>He doesn't treat me anything like a girl,</i>

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.590
<i>and I'm always the only one 
who's all hyper-aware.</i>

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.810
<i>Even though my heart's pounding so hard...</i>

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.310
<i>I feel so stupid!</i>

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:17.990
<b>Tomo's</b>

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:17.990
<b>Skirt</b>

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.570
"Tomo's Skirt."

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.040
<i>It's getting pretty crowded.</i>

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:38.090
<i>Wh-What?! Is this what they call a groper?!</i>

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.880
<i>Wait, that couldn't happen 
to </i>me<i> of all people...</i>

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:42.050
<i>He just groped me?!</i>

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.680
<i>I just wanna slug him right now!</i>

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:46.560
<i>But...</i>

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:50.980
<i>I'm not sure why, but I don't 
want Jun to know about this.</i>

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.570
<i>This is so gross.</i>

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:58.150
<i>I feel like I have to just put 
up with it, or I'll start crying.</i>

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:06.040
What the hell do you think you're doing?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.040
<i>Jun took care of everything,
from reporting the guy</i>

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.170
<i>to handing him over to the authorities.</i>

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:17.460
Lock him up for life, please.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.090
Tomo, you okay?

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.970
Oh... Yeah...

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.680
Be sure to go talk to the police later.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.680
<i>I've never seen Jun like this before.</i>

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.560
Gonna be a pain in the ass, but...

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:31.270
<i>I feel like he's actually treating 
me like a girl right now.</i>

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.850
Also, you know...

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:36.360
Hey! Are you listening?

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.280
Huh? Wh-What's up?

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.740
I was saying...

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.910
Maybe you should stop wearing skirts.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:47.830
Huh?

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:51.710
What did you just say?

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:55.210
When I got groped on the 
bus yesterday, Jun said—

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.380
What's this about groping?

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.510
What did he do to you? Are you okay?

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.970
Oh... Yeah...

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:05.090
He just touched my butt a little.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:06.970
Did you take him to the police?

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.100
You didn't let him go, did you?

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.980
Jun took care of all that.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.770
I see.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.150
Uh... Misuzu?

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.570
Anyway, what were you saying about him?

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:26.280
Huh? Oh...

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.570
Well, he said...

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:30.160
What the hell are you saying?

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:34.370
Our school allows girls to wear slacks, too.
 Why not wear those?

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.210
But why are you suddenly 
bringing this up <i>now</i>?

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:38.920
Why? Because...

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:40.130
It...

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.380
It looks wrong on you!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.090
And I can't relax when you're wearing it.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.720
I know damn well it looks wrong on me!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.180
Jun, you asshole!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:57.310
Just when I thought he was finally 
treating me like a girl!

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.860
That jerk!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:04:59.900
I see.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.320
But if you think about the circumstances,

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:06.530
he may have said it because he doesn't 
want you getting groped again.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.570
Huh?

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:10.490
You mean he was thinking about me that way?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.370
<i>Jun</i> was?

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:17.170
I'm sorry. That was an 
irresponsible thing to say.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:21.000
No?! So there's no chance of that at all?!

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.760
Anyway, I noticed a while ago, 
but hadn't said anything...

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:28.140
Your skirt is pretty short.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:33.310
I didn't think you were the type 
to enjoy showing that much leg.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:35.140
Why do you wear it so short?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.940
Well, 'cause it's easier to move around in.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.940
What other reason would there be?

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.940
Yeah, skirts really aren't meant for you.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.320
For starters...

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.200
Try taking off the shorts for a while.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.620
What?! No way!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.330
What are you getting all pervy for?!

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.540
I'm not.

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:55.200
Look, Tomo...

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.750
The normal way to wear a skirt is with 
nothing but your panties underneath.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.880
You liar!

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:02.460
If your skirt flipped up, 
people would see everything!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.460
That's what skirts <i>are</i>.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.880
Even I...

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.380
only have panties on under mine today.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.840
Huh?!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.640
That's the kind of girl you are?

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:15.220
I haven't done anything to 
deserve that creeped-out look.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.650
Junichiro.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:23.980
Huh?

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:26.110
I heard what happened.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.570
You had a fight with Tomo, huh?

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:29.950
Lay off.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.780
Tomo says she wants to walk home with you.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.200
She's waiting downstairs. 
You'd better go now.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:41.210
For real?! She's not mad anymore?!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.000
That's right.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.040
Sweet!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.180
Hey, Jun.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.060
Let's walk home together.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:01.560
Jun?!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.900
Let's go.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.820
Y-Yeah...

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.570
<i>Just try going without the shorts for now.</i>

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.160
<i>I bet that'll get a different 
reaction out of Junichiro.</i>

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.700
<i>I ended up taking them off like Misuzu said.</i>

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:21.290
Hey, Jun...

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.090
Sorry I hit you so hard yesterday.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.000
Okay?

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.760
<i>She's right. Jun's reacting totally 
differently than he has before.</i>

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.050
Huh?

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:34.800
Jun?!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.770
<i>In fact, he's being just plain weird!</i>

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.560
Standing room only again?

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.440
This bus is always packed lately.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:52.400
m 195 284 l 195 324 444 324 444 284

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:52.400
<b>Junichiro Vision</b>

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:04.040
<i>Jun's walking faster than usual today.</i>

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.710
Hey, Jun!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.880
<i>What's his problem?</i>

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.550
<i>It's almost like he's 
running away from me.</i>

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.820
Wait up, would you?!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.480
Jun?!

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.780
Sorry.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:34.740
Huh?

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.200
Something was wrong with me yesterday.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:42.230
I know just being best buds doesn't give me 
the right to tell you to dress differently.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.410
But...

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:47.840
I don't think it's right to wear 
stuff that <i>you</i> feel embarrassed in.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.090
It messes things up for me, too.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:55.260
<i>Jun's making such an interesting face!</i>

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.590
Are you even listening to me?

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:05.350
How'd it go after you took 
off the shorts yesterday?

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:07.900
It went horribly! That's how!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.730
I'm never dressing like that again!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.110
Did he see your panties?

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.570
Bull's-eye.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.910
Okay, and how did Junichiro react?

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:22.790
Actually, I don't really know why, but...

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:24.160
He dropped like a rock.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:33.010
I hear you haven't said 
a word to Tomo all day.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.920
She seemed pretty sad.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.590
Shut up.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:40.850
It's unusual for you to 
avoid Tomo for half a day.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:44.810
I guess it'll take a while for 
you to reset this time, huh?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:47.480
Go on, try—

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:02.120
Heya, Tomo! Let's eat lunch together!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:02.830
Jun!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:06.040
I keep telling you not to pop 
up outta nowhere like that!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.580
Aw, don't be mean!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.170
I'm not!

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.540
I'm just acting like I always do!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:14.550
<i>It'll be interesting to see 
how long this keeps up.</i>

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.920
See? See? See? See?

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:13.750
You little—

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:22.010
<b>The School Idol</b>

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.720
"The School Idol."

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:24.010
Good morning, Carol-chan!

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.270
Morning.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.140
You look as cute as ever!

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.440
Can I carry your bag for you?

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.230
No, thanks.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.700
There she is. Carol Olston.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.410
Surrounded from the moment she 
shows up, just like every day.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.370
If she's the most popular with the guys,

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.660
does that mean she's the girliest?

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.500
It's hard to say.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.500
Must be nice... How do 
you even get that way?

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.510
For starters...

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:58.720
Put down the dumbbell.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.600
She's not just popular for her looks.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:07.890
She's also the only English student in the 
school, so she has a certain premium feel.

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.440
Also...

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.980
What?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.440
Her personality.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:20.320
That soft, defenseless feel she has 
hits the guys right in their instincts.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:22.780
What, so being defenseless is good?

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:25.370
Someone like that would get 
knocked out in no time!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:30.370
You should really stop thinking 
in terms of knocking people out.

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:38.260
<i>How can being defenseless 
actually be better?</i>

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.760
<i>If I make friends with 
that cotton candy chick,</i>

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.260
<i>will I find out?</i>

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:45.180
Aizawa-san!

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:50.020
What's wrong? You look lost in thought.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.850
Misaki-senpai...

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.940
Whoa! Cotton Candy!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.320
Cotton Candy?

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:59.070
What are you two doing together?

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:02.240
She's a distant relative of mine.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.700
You could say we've been friends 
since we were little... or...

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.570
We're engaged.

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.660
Engaged?!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.790
Are you... serious?

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.660
You two are getting married someday?

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:13.670
It has been discussed, I guess...

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:15.750
We've already gotten married.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.130
Three times.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:23.050
She's talking about when we were kids,
 <i>pretending</i> to get married!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:27.140
Anyway, are you a friend of Carol's?

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:30.350
No, we haven't really talked much,

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:32.060
but we're in the same class.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.310
Right?

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.190
You don't remember?

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.650
Dunno.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.990
I'm not interested in the boys in our class.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:44.150
I'm a girl! Do you not see the skirt?!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.530
S-Sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.830
She's a little strange,

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.120
but she doesn't mean any harm,
 so let it slide, okay?

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:54.420
Well, if you say so, Senpai.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:58.380
Thanks, Aizawa-san. 
You're a really nice person.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:01.210
Huh? Not really...

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.220
A girl...

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:06.890
Poke!

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.810
She doesn't... mean any harm, right?

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.980
Hey... Come on, Carol!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.150
Dummy.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:21.610
Dummy.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.030
Dummy.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.570
So... what's that all about?

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.330
That's what <i>I</i> wanna know.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:33.700
I only talked to her for 
the first time today,

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.330
but she's apparently 
Misaki-senpai's fiancée.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:37.620
Ah, I get it.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:41.630
And Senpai was with you when 
you talked to her, wasn't he?

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.090
Yeah, he was.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:48.390
And you have no idea why she picked 
a fight with you in that situation?

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.600
Right. I don't remember doing anything.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.060
Dummy.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.980
Why are you doing that now, too?!

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:57.980
Misuzu-chan, Misuzu-chan.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:00.440
There's something I want 
to talk to you about.

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.400
Fine...

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.780
But first, get off my desk.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.740
Okay.

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:08.530
Let's get this out of the way first.

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.950
I'm not fond of people like you.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.790
Okay, got it.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.580
I want to ask you some 
questions about Tomo-chan.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.000
You're tough.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.460
You seem to see Tomo as your enemy,

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.550
but no matter what you might think, 
I consider myself her best friend.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:27.930
If you're trying to dig up dirt,
 ask someone else.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:31.140
Even if I'd treat you to cake? It's tasty...

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:33.810
I'll hear you out, at least.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.180
Okay, so...

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:38.350
How do you think I can defeat Tomo-chan?

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.770
At least try to cover up 
your malice a <i>little</i> bit.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.070
<i>Now, I wonder how I can use this girl.</i>

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.190
If that's what you want to know...

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.990
There's someone else who 
can help you more than me.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:54.080
Hey, who's your favorite girl in first year?

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.000
Carol-chan, obviously!

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.410
She's as cute as a doll!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:02.500
Mine's Misuzu-chan! I love those icy eyes!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.040
Hi.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.340
Are you Kubota Junichiro?

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.090
Yeah, that's me.

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:10.550
There's something I want 
to talk to you about.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.680
<b>Boys' Locker Room</b>

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:12.680
First of all...

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.100
Get out of my locker.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:18.520
I said there was someone I want to defeat,

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.690
and I was referred to you.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.020
So Gundo sent you, huh?

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.110
I don't really like that, but...

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:30.990
<i>I'm surprised there's someone besides 
her who'd want to beat someone up.</i>

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:36.120
I was just looking for a way to kill 
time while my buddy's doing club stuff.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.910
I'll help pump you up if you 
can meet me after school.

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:40.210
Pump me up?

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:43.250
First, let's see you hit 
me as hard as you can.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.250
Like this?

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.550
I was hoping you'd hit my hand, actually...

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.880
Anyway, you're pretty damn weak, aren't you?

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.340
A kitten could beat you up.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.810
Are you going to make me stronger?

00:15:56.810 --> 00:16:01.060
Well, it depends on how far you're 
willing to go, but give me a month.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.020
I'll get you to bear cub level, at least.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.020
Are those strong?

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:11.530
Yo, let's go, Blondie.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.570
My name isn't Blondie.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.450
It's Carol.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.530
Whatever. Just come on.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:18.660
'Kay!

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.500
Yes, I know.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.540
Did you see that?! What was that about?!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.050
Why is Jun acting like that with her?!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.960
I don't know, but...

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.800
It's obvious that something happened.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:38.470
For Junichiro to be like that 
with a girl who isn't you...

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:41.810
Maybe they're actually...

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.230
No! No way!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:46.400
I mean, she has a fiancé!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.230
Wait, but... maybe...

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.360
<i>That's right, Tomo.</i>

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:54.150
<i>That's the sense of urgency 
that you need more of.</i>

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.910
Okay, we're gonna start by running.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.490
'Kay!

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:05.830
What's wrong?

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.090
I can't run any more.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:10.670
Are you kidding me?

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.130
<i>I wonder...</i>

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.930
<i>what Jun and that girl 
are up to right now...</i>

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.140
<i>Jun...</i>

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.020
A-Aizawa-san...

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.150
Captain!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.570
Next is strength training.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.900
'Kay!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.860
One...

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.240
I can't.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.320
One...

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:39.950
I can't.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:44.410
Look... What <i>can</i> you do?

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.540
I can jump rope.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.500
'Cause I like bunnies.

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:51.050
Okay, I don't know what 
that means, but go for it.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.310
Why are you looking up?

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.890
Neck exercise!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.020
Jun! This is where you've...

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:08.650
been...

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.480
Okay, when your enemy comes 
up on you like this...

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.730
Hey, there's my enemy!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:16.740
You were talking about Tomo?!

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.490
She's really strong, though!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:18.940
Wha...

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:21.740
What the hell are you guys doing?!

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:24.950
I asked you what you're doing, damn it!

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:28.420
H-Hey... What are you so mad about?

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:31.380
I'm not mad! I'm just asking!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.260
Just stick close to him, 
and you'll find out in no time.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:38.090
Assuming you're not a total idiot, that is.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.010
I lose.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.850
Tomo-chan, Tomo-chan.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.560
I'm done being your enemy now, okay?

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:46.310
Huh?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.270
I'm done with this training, too.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:50.810
Bye-bye!

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:57.740
I came along because you promised 
to treat me to cake...

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:01.160
But why are we in this 
unnecessarily long car?

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:03.990
And who is that guy in the black suit?

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.910
I dunno.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.620
You're the one who called him.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:11.790
There are lots of guys in black suits 
at my house whose names I don't know.

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:14.000
Don't you have any at your house?

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.130
I'm pretty sure most people don't.

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.590
Hey, so, Misuzu-chan...

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.680
Since we're eating cake together,

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:24.390
does that mean we're friends now?

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:25.720
I'm not sure.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.310
Do you want friends?

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:29.230
Yeah!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:32.270
I don't have even a single friend.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.270
Dunno why.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.360
Indeed, I wonder why.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:40.200
If you want friends, 
you should talk to Tomo.

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:42.780
I'm sure she'd be your friend.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:45.740
<i>And it would be a great 
motivator for Tomo, too.</i>

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:50.830
Hmm... I did a lot of mean 
things to her, though.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:52.960
So you do feel bad about it, then?

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.040
That doesn't matter, though.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:59.630
She's nice to a fault toward 
anyone who approaches her.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:03.640
She calls a girl like me 
her best friend, after all.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:06.310
I see...

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:08.770
Even despite your bad personality, huh?

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:11.230
That's exactly your problem.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.310
Hey, Tomo-chan!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:17.270
Oh, it's you. What is it now?

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.860
Well...

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:20.900
Fwiend!

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.070
Ew, no way.

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:25.070
Friends?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.830
Uh, I dunno...

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.040
Let's not...

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:36.000
Um... It's kind of hard to say, but...

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.960
<i>Th-There's something that's 
hard for </i>her<i> to say?</i>

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:42.380
<i>What kind of crazy thing 
is she about to say?!</i>

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:46.300
I want you to be my friend!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.260
Huh?

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.390
Oh, sure, that's fine.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:50.890
Huh?

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:53.190
Jeez, that's what you wanted?

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:56.270
I didn't know what I was gonna do 
if you called me your enemy again.

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:00.360
Okay, well... nice to know ya!

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.830
Tomo-chan, you're...

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.580
just like an angel!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.290
Huh? An a-angel?!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.420
Misuzu-chan, will you be my friend, too?

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:23.510
Fine with me.

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.130
You seem to be pretty rich, after all.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:28.010
Yay!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.260
I'm so glad I'm rich!

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.810
I never thought I'd end up 
being friends with her.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.770
She's pretty nice once you 
talk to her a little.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:40.270
Huh...

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:44.110
That blonde and Gundo are apparently 
pretty popular with the guys.

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:48.370
Well, they're both cute and girly, I guess.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:49.830
Are they?

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:55.540
Well, not that I'm in any place 
to say much about Gundo...

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.540
Huh?!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:58.460
Wait, are you saying you 
have a thing for Misuzu?!

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:00.000
Hell no.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.050
You know we went out for a 
while in middle school, right?

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:05.550
Huh?
